000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. SMSTINQSI.
000400
000500 AUTHOR. KURT MOVSESIAN.
000600*REMARKS.
000700*
000800******************************************************
      *  COPIED FROM PROGRAM SMSTINQS AND MODIFIED FOR     *
      *  INPUT ONLY.                                       *
      ******************************************************
000900*                                                    *
001000*   S M S T I N Q S                   SAP3           *
001100*                                                    *
001200*   THIS SUB PROGRAM IS AN INQUIRY/UPDATE FOR THE    *
001300*   LOCAL STORES ACCOUNTING SYSTEM.  THE CORPORATE   *
001400*   CODE MUST RESIDE IN 2 DATA BASES.  THE 2 DATA    *
001500*   BASES THAT ARE OPENED ARE 'STORES' AND 'CSACCT'. *
001600*   THE ONLY FIELDS THAT CAN BE UPDATED ARE :        *
001700*     1) WRITEDOWN DEPT.  2) ACCOUNT                 *
001800*     3) REPORT CODE                                 *
001900*   ALL OF THESE FIELDS RESIDE IN THE 'CSACCT'       *
002000*   DATA BASE                                        *
002100*                                                    *
002100******************************************************
002100*                                                    *
002100*  C O M M E N T S                                   *
002100*                                                    *
002100*  10/17/94      C A ZUBEK                           *
002100*  -ADDED A CALL TO THE SUBROUTINE "TALTKEY" TO      *
002100*   ALLOW THE USER TO TYPE IN AN ALTERNATE KEY.  THE *
002100*   VALUE OF THE CORPORATE CODE CORRESPONDING TO THE *
002100*   ALTERNATE KEY IS RETURNED FROM THE SUBROUTINE.   *
002100*                                                    *
002100*  -ALSO INCREASED THE SIZE OF THE ENTRY SCREEN      *
002100*   CORPORATE CODE FIELD TO ALLOW FOR THE 12-BYTE    *
002100*   ALTERNATE KEY FIELD.                             *
      *                                                    *
JC9803*C   23MAR1998  JIM COFFMAN
JC9803*C     REVISED TO COMPUTE THE VALUE OF ONHAND-ACUUM  *
JC9803*C     USING THE BIN ONHAND QUANTITIES FOR BINS THAT *
JC9803*C     ARE NOT OWNED BY A VENDOR. THIS CHANGE IS     *
JC9803*C     NEEDED TO ACCOMMODATE THE OWNERSHIP BY BIN    *
JC9803*C     LOCATION CONCEPT WHICH WAS CREATED FOR USE    *
JC9803*C     IN DANVILLE FOR MATERIALS OWNED BY ISC.       *
JC9803*C
      *C* 06/21/1996  CA YODER                             *
      *C* RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES. *
      *                                                    *
002200******************************************************
002300*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S   *
002400*         C A L L E D    B Y :                       *
002500*      1. TMSTRINQ                                   *
002600******************************************************
002700
002800
002900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       SPECIAL-NAMES.        I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
003000
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZMSTRINQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT MATLACUM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MATLACUM-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MCHTACCTS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MREPORT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DTRANS-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
003400
003100 DATA DIVISION.
003200 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC           PIC X(2000).
       FD  MATLACUM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MATLACUM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0601.
       FD  MATLACUM-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MATLACUM-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0601.
       FD  MCHTACCTS-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MCHTACCTS-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0301.
       FD  MREPORT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MREPORT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0401.
       FD  DTRANS-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCA0701.
       FD  MSTORERM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0201.

